    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kinetic is a first-person parkour game with smooth and responsive movements. It's all about optimizing trajectories, using momentum and portals to complete each level as quickly as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You move through three different environments:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>concrete dimension</strong>, with its standard first-person parkour moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>ice dimension</strong>, which lets you glide at speed, much like you would on a skating rink. This dimension is inspired by Counter Strike's surf mode and Urban Terror's icy mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>bounce dimension</strong>, which lets you bounce on any surface without losing momentum.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've unlocked the dimensions, you'll be free to switch from one to the other whenever you like using the portal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, you can compare yourself to other players or your friends thanks to the integrated leaderboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire up your favorite playlist and get caught up in the speedrun frenzy! GL HF :)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kinetic is a first-person parkour game with smooth and responsive movements. It's all about optimizing trajectories, using momentum and portals to complete each level as quickly as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You move through three different environments:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>concrete dimension</strong>, with its standard first-person parkour moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>ice dimension</strong>, which lets you glide at speed, much like you would on a skating rink. This dimension is inspired by Counter Strike's surf mode and Urban Terror's icy mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>bounce dimension</strong>, which lets you bounce on any surface without losing momentum.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've unlocked the dimensions, you'll be free to switch from one to the other whenever you like using the portal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, you can compare yourself to other players or your friends thanks to the integrated leaderboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire up your favorite playlist and get caught up in the speedrun frenzy! GL HF :)</p>",
